0..76 Comment "// A site that reads its newer module as the older store, through a renaming"
77..95 Comment "// and via a flow."
96..98 Comment "//"
99..174 Comment "// The site keeps the newer module, and the role keeps the older signature."
175..243 Comment "// A translation joins them at the boundary, and no code runs there."
244..246 Comment "//"
247..323 Comment "// The offer names a translation after each module. `store = Echo renaming {"
324..401 Comment "// fetch as get }` reads `Echo`\'s `fetch` as `get`, and every other member as"
402..481 Comment "// itself. `cache = Echo via downgrade` reads `Echo` through the published flow"
482..543 Comment "// `downgrade`, which resolves as an import\'s `via` resolves."
544..546 Comment "//"
547..625 Comment "// - see: `translated.gandr` — the role whose `far` requires the older store"
626..699 Comment "// - see: `translated.manifold.gandr` — the manifold placing `far` here"
